1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,807
Next time you hear a song you love, listen
for the bass notes and the melody. Notice

2
00:00:04,852 --> 00:00:10,159
how some note combinations feel resolved
and peaceful, while others create tension.

3
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:14,396
That's mathematics at work in every piece
of music ever written.
